        "A contract's satisfaction is over the open component's traces (its traces in an arbitrary environment, Comp.Open); contracts are not attached to specification components or checked by exegra.",
        "refines_liveness reads a run as its sequence of states, so a property of labels is not covered; MapsFair asks every step of the implementation's fair action to be a step of the specification that only the mapped fair action makes.",
        "Product installation (admitProduct in cli/admit.js) shows a product claim holds on its own scenario and refutes it on the composed scenario by complete exploration in JavaScript (src/core/refinement-explore.js over the step of src/core/replay.js), not by a Lean theorem, so a product claim is not proved; exegra admit has no option yet to install a product file from the command line (WG-5685 criterion 7).",
